   = help: the trait `Rangeable` is not implemented for `BinaryStream<Chunks, OctetStream>`
   = note: `Range<T>` and `Ranged<T>` take a body that is already octets of a known length, which is `Binary<M>`
   = note: `Text` holds a `String` and `Json<T>` a document, and a byte range of either is neither; a stream has no complete length to state and no way to seek within it
